<p>		     (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						    QUARTER ENDED</p>
<p>						Jan. 5,	     Jan. 5,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				   $102,323	    $59,252</p>
<p> Net income				    3,115		1,319</p>
